### 배송 목록 조회 (전체)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/deliveries?page=0&size=10

### 배송 목록 조회 (상태 필터)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/deliveries?page=0&size=10&status=READY

### 배송 목록 조회 (담당자 필터)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/deliveries?page=0&size=10&deliveryManagerId=eeeeeeee-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 배송 목록 조회 (정렬 - 오래된 순)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/deliveries?page=0&size=10&sortBy=createdAt&direction=ASC

### 배송 단건 조회 (READY - shipment 2개)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/deliveries/aaaaaaaa-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 배송 단건 조회 (IN_PROGRESS - 담당자 배정)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/deliveries/aaaaaaaa-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### 배송 생성
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "bbbbbbbb-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "sourceHubId": "dddddddd-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "vendorId": "dddddddd-0000-0000-0000-000000000003"
}
